Bootstrap a zero-dependency single-page demo site for the frontend module — pure HTML/CSS/JS, no build step.

## Structure
- `index.html` — semantic multi-section layout: hero, features, color palette, animation demos, interactive components (tabs, cards, modal), animated stats, contact form, footer
- `styles.css` — design token–driven (CSS custom properties), fluid typography via `clamp()`, CSS Grid + Flexbox, `@keyframes` animations, responsive breakpoints at 768px/480px
- `script.js` — all vanilla JS; `IntersectionObserver` for scroll-reveal and counter/progress triggers, typewriter effect, particle generator, accessible modal, hamburger menu, form validation

## Highlights

**CSS animations (pure CSS, no JS)**
```css
@keyframes demoMorph {
  0%,100% { border-radius: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%; }
  50%     { border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 50%; }
}
```

**JS scroll-triggered counters**
```js
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
  entries.forEach(entry => {
    if (entry.isIntersecting) { animateCounter(entry.target); observer.unobserve(entry.target); }
  });
}, { threshold: 0.4 });
```

